ive. However, further evaluation may also reveal the presence of DVT, which would also be a contributing factor to the stroke. The other answer choices (A) Patent foramen ovale, (B) Atrial myxoma, (C) Mitral valve vegetation, and (D) Atrial fibrillation, are less likely given the patient's clinical",
