 adding bupropion, or switching to fluoxetine after discussing the risks and benefits with the patient. Option D, addition of sildenafil, may be considered if erectile dysfunction is present and other underlying medical conditions have been ruled out. Option E, switch to selegiline, is not a recommended option.",
