ent's most likely form of diabetes.\n- Answer E, unrelated to his abdominal obesity, is not consistent with the patient's characteristics and diagnosis.\n- Answers A, B, C, and D are not consistent with the patient's most likely form of diabetes.\n- Therefore, the correct answer is E) Unrelated to his abdominal obesity.",
