                        "instruction": "qa-16",
                        "cot_trigger": null,
                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Helpful knowledge: As people age, their respiratory function changes. Lung compliance decreases, vital capacity decreases, residual volume increases, chest wall compliance decreases, and the A-a gradient increases.\n\nSub-questions:\n1. What is lung compliance?\n2. How does lung compliance change with age?\n3. What is vital capacity?\n4. How does vital capacity change with age?\n5. What is residual volume?\n6. How does residual volume change with age?\n7. What is chest wall compliance?\n8. How does chest wall compliance change with age?\n9. What is the A-a gradient?\n10. How does the A-a gradient change with age?\n\nAnswers:\n1. Lung compliance is the measure of how easily the lungs can expand and contract.\n2. Lung compliance decreases with age.\n3. Vital capacity is the maximum amount of air a person can exhale after taking a deep breath.\n4. Vital capacity decreases with age.\n5. Residual volume is the amount of air that remains in the lungs after a maximal exhalation.\n6. Residual volume increases with age.\n7. Chest wall compliance is the measure of how easily the chest wall can expand and contract.\n8. Chest wall compliance decreases with age.\n9. The A-a gradient is the difference in oxygen concentration between the alveoli and the arterial blood.\n10. The A-a gradient increases with age.\n\nAnswer: C) Decreased residual volume. Based on the given information and the knowledge that residual volume increases with age, we can eliminate options A, B, and D. The A-a gradient increases with age, so we can eliminate option E. Therefore, the most likely change in respiratory function in this patient is a decreased residual volume.",
                        "answers": [
                            {
                                "id": "8d355ba9-8baf-438c-9572-b82c9ad2d70f",
                                "answer_extraction": "kojima-A-E",
