                                "answer_extraction_text": "",
                                "answer": "C) Glucuronyl transferase deficiency, as it is the only condition listed that directly affects the liver's ability to convert indirect bilirubin to direct bilirubin, leading to a high percentage of direct bilirubin in the blood.",
