                        "cot": "A) Epiblast only: This option is incorrect as it suggests that all three germ layers are derived from only one layer, which is not the case.\n\nB) Ectoderm from epiblast; mesoderm and endoderm from hypoblast: This option is also incorrect as it suggests that the mesoderm and endoderm are derived from the hypoblast, which is not true. The mesoderm and endoderm are both derived from the epiblast.\n\nC) Ectoderm and mesoderm from epiblast; endoderm from hypoblast: This option is correct. The ectoderm and mesoderm are both derived from the epiblast, while the endoderm is derived from the hypoblast.\n\nD) Hypoblast only: This option is incorrect as it suggests that only one germ layer is derived from the hypoblast, which is not true.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is C) Ectoderm and mesoderm from epiblast; endoderm from hypoblast.",
